# Action Learning Project

## Description
This project implements a text-to-music modal system that converts textual descriptions into musical compositions. Using advanced natural language processing and deep learning techniques, it generates melodies, harmonies, and rhythms based on text input. The system supports various musical styles and can output MIDI files for further editing or playback.

## Getting Started

### Installation
```bash
conda create --name actionlearning python=3.9
conda activate actionlearning
```

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Running the Application
```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

Navigate to `http://localhost:8501` in your web browser to access the application interface.

## Features
* creating the music 
* create an animation
* share the music you created
